{"articleNo":"418830","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=418830&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] ★KIT Engineering Fair 2022 구미코 이동 셔틀 시간표 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.12.02","hit":"6953","attachments":[{"name":"KIT Fair 행사 구미코 이동 지원 버스 배차 시간표.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=418830&attachNo=119126"},{"name":"KIT Fair 2022 개최 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=418830&attachNo=119127"},{"name":"KIT Engineering Fair 2022 참가 및 참관 재학생 공결 신청 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=418830&attachNo=119128"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">12월 8일~9일 양일간 구미코에서 개최되는&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 18pt;\">KIT Engineering Fair 2022 행사 참석(참가자 및 참관자)<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">을&nbsp;</span></span></b></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\">지원</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">하기 위해&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">행사기간동안 학교(신평동 캠퍼스 포함)에서&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">구미코로 이동하는 셔틀버스를 운행합니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1. 운행 기간: 12월 8일(목) ~ 9일(금)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">2. 탑승 및 하차&nbsp;장소</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 양호동 캠퍼스:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;디지털관 옆 셔틀 승강장</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;신평동 캠퍼스: 정문 셔틀 승강장</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3. 운행 시간: 아래의 시간표 참조</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">※ 12월 8일 11시 30분 출발 버스는 <span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">K</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">IT Engine</span>ering Fair 참가자(출품팀)가&nbsp;차편이 없어서&nbsp;심사에 불참하는 일이 없도록&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">심사참석을 지원하기 위해</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;운행하며&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"sensEdContentAreaCls\" data-id=\"sensEdContentArea\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: dotum; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">탑승권을 소지한 학생을 12월 8일 11시 30분 출발 셔틀버스에 우선 탑승시키고</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: transparent; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">잔여석에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">일반 참관자 또는 다른 팀원들이 탑승하도록 할 예정입니다.</span></div><div class=\"sensEdContentAreaCls\" data-id=\"sensEdContentArea\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: transparent; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">탑승권은 학과행정실로 배포되었으니 개별 수령하여 팀원 간 상의 후 대표 1인을 정하여 탑승해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></div><div class=\"sensEdContentAreaCls\" data-id=\"sensEdContentArea\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">(심사에 참석 할 다른 팀원이나 일반 참관자는&nbsp;이전 버스나 다음 버스를 이용을 권장합니다.)</span></div><div class=\"sensEdContentAreaCls\" data-id=\"sensEdContentArea\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><br></div><div class=\"sensEdContentAreaCls\" data-id=\"sensEdContentArea\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwegRkgTBhAdgLQAoDcAWAZALgGwCsBnADzwCcA1CgB2QDpDaBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
